  "description": "Reopen r-sort-3-corpus-mdb (MDB) read-only. Reads (a.ID, b.ID) for every pair of T and of U rows where a.K = b.K and a.ID < b.ID (SQL self-join equality); (MIN ID, MAX ID, COUNT) for every K group with more than one row (GROUP BY K); COUNT of DISTINCT K in T; the IDs that survived the one-INSERT-per-row loads into the unique-indexed tables W (from T) and W2 (from U). Asks the public equality classes through SQL comparison, grouping and unique-index refusal, as separate observations.",
